Package: merchantKycConsole
Title: Merchant Compliance and KYC Review Console
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R:
    person("Analyst", "Daniel AMAH", email = "danielamahtoday@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A Shiny application for compliance analysts to review merchant
    onboarding and periodic-review KYC cases. Provides a filterable case
    queue, detail view, sanctions screening, action panel with mandatory
    justification, and an append-only audit trail. Business rules are
    isolated as pure functions to enable independent unit testing.
